{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made within a month for <i>NaNoRenO 2023.</i> Now enhanced for Steam!</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/ae2776f180c74d9839da38d46f7288c0.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/ae2776f180c74d9839da38d46f7288c0.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/ae2776f180c74d9839da38d46f7288c0.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>I, the <i>great</i> <strong>Cautionne,</strong> <i>Disciple of Danger </i>and <i>Emperor of MalViolence,</i> am holding <strong>you</strong> as my latest test subject.</strong><br><br>'Course, <i>you</i> trespassed on my lair first, so it\u2019s not like you can complain.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/6aac86139a0eab92839c0bed249f0fd5.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/6aac86139a0eab92839c0bed249f0fd5.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/6aac86139a0eab92839c0bed249f0fd5.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>I get it. You <i>wanted</i> something from me. Or your boss did. Or your boss\u2019s boss did. <br><br>So how about we make a deal?  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You solve my escape rooms, do a little lab work, consult on a deadly trap or two, and I'll let you leave scot-free. Doesn't that sound nice? <br><br>But before you go, let me give you some advice...  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Don't make any mistakes.</strong><br><br><strong>Because if you do - you're <i>not</i> gonna like what happens next. </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/ca3f0619ac635e659c777eb58d342cca.avif?t=1769379166\" width=456 height=88 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A gripping, villainous scenario</strong> written by <strong>Mado,</strong> <i>Of The Devil's</i> <strong>Brian Mulholland, </strong>and <strong>Z.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Escape rooms</strong> with several brain-bending puzzles, crafted by <strong>speck</strong> and <i>Artificial Selection's</i> <strong>KigyoDev.</strong><br></li><li><strong>3 main endings</strong> and <i>even more</i> bad endings.<br></li><li><strong>Animated, speaking CGs: </strong>all drawn by <strong>Mado!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Partial voice-acting</strong> by the talented <strong>Carrick Inabnett</strong> and <strong>Vyn Vox,</strong> with the direction of <i>Very Berry Studio's</i> <strong>Phebe Fabacher!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Gorgeous, rendered backgrounds</strong> by <strong>Reina!</strong><br></li><li><strong>A slick UI</strong> by <strong>spicaze!</strong><br></li><li><strong>An 100% original soundtrack</strong> by <strong>Melo-dii</strong> and <strong>Doran.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Audio mastering and mixing</strong> by <i>Cooking Companions'</i> <strong>D.ray!</strong><br></li><li><strong>An eye-catching trailer</strong> by <strong>Mado</strong> and <strong>jennymhulla!</strong><br></li><li><strong>1 cute mad scientist</strong> with a hidden agenda\u2026<br><br><i>(This project also features tools by <strong>dmochas,</strong> <strong>tofurocks,</strong> <strong>wattson,</strong> <strong>glsuoa,</strong> and <strong>npckc</strong>.)</i></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rude Awakening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2403570/51fcafa5d9a1cdce6b2f5c25a08d10b90cd97193.jpg"},{"name":"TFNG","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2403570/5f5364b6e911058c57fec20d8a2bda2364cb1f36.jpg"},{"name":"Lab Partner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2403570/654f32f48b262a8f2ddd48e25e3f33c8808b6477.jpg"},{"name":"Private Study","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2403570/206e3f031399156c5b847109a41ed610de31bc93.jpg"},{"name":"Housewarming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2403570/8799cf3457508f47a6634c412d344b08a75b7fe3.jpg"},{"name":"Trial and Error","path":"https://cdn.akama